# OpenHiggsfield (local studio)

This repo is the open-source Higgsfield studio from https://github.com/wide-trace/open-higgsfield.

## Run

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm dev
```

Studio URL: http://localhost:3000

## Generate

- The Next.js server talks to `https://platform.higgsfield.ai` (`HF_API_BASE_URL` in `.env`).
- The user pastes their Higgsfield platform key in the UI as `id:secret` (from https://cloud.higgsfield.ai / https://console.higgsfield.ai). It is stored in an httpOnly cookie.
- Do not put the platform key in `.env` or commit it.
- Image/video uploads need `OPEN_HIGGSFIELD_READ_WRITE_TOKEN` (a Vercel Blob read-write token). Prompt-only generations work without it.

## Cursor

Prefer this local studio for UI work. The official Higgsfield Cursor plugin/MCP can generate from chat if the user authenticates it separately.
